{"sha": "5749f898ccba043afdbe472a86ebf44f38be2a9461d7f49e0cdb0970006351d4", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % water", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\node[aO] (o) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h1) at (-0.82,-0.6) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h2) at (0.82,-0.6) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (h1.center); \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (h2.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node[omThm] at (0,0.55) {$2\\delta^-$};", "    \\node[omDef] at (-1.22,-0.5) {$\\delta^+$};", "    \\node[omDef] at (1.22,-0.5) {$\\delta^+$};", "    \\fill[omDef] (0,-0.6) circle (0.06);", "    \\fill[omThm] (0,0) circle (0.06);", "    \\draw[densely dotted, black!60] (-0.82,-0.6) -- (0.82,-0.6);", "    \\draw[<-, black!60] (0.08,-0.64) -- (1.55,-1.05) node[right, align=left,", "      font=\\footnotesize] {$\\delta^+$ 的\\\\中心};", "    \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-1.8) {水：折线形，\\textbf{极性}};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % carbon dioxide", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6cm]", "    \\node[aO] (o1) at (-1.15,0) {};", "    \\node[aC] (c) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aO] (o2) at (1.15,0) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond, double, double distance=1.6pt] (o1.center) -- (c.center);", "      \\draw[bond, double, double distance=1.6pt] (c.center) -- (o2.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node[omThm] at (-1.15,0.55) {$\\delta^-$};", "    \\node[omThm] at (1.15,0.55) {$\\delta^-$};", "    \\node[omDef] at (0,0.55) {$2\\delta^+$};", "    \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (-0.25,-0.45) -- (-1.0,-0.45);", "    \\draw[->, omProp, thick] (0.25,-0.45) -- (1.0,-0.45);", "    \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-1.8) {二氧化碳：直线形，\\\\", "      \\textbf{非极性}};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 在水中，折线形的结构使正部分电荷的中心（位于两个氢原子之间）", "位于氧原子下方，因此水是极性分子。", "在二氧化碳中，两个极性键的作用方向相反（见箭头），", "相互抵消，电荷中心重合于", "碳原子上。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "", "\\begin{example}[四种分子]\\label{ex:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:four}", "氯化氢 \\ce{HCl} 含有一个极性键，是极性分子，其中氯原子带 $\\delta^-$。", "氨 \\ce{NH3} 为三角锥形，含三个极性 \\ce{N-H} 键，是极性分子，其中氮原子带 $\\delta^-$。", "甲烷 \\ce{CH4} 中只有近似非极性的", "\\ce{C-H} 键，是非极性分子。四氯化碳 \\ce{CCl4} 含有四个极性", "\\ce{C-Cl} 键，但它们分布在正四面体的顶点上，", "相互抵消，因此该分子是非极性分子。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{范德瓦耳斯相互作用}", "", "\\begin{definition}[范德瓦耳斯相互作用]\\label{def:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:van-der-waals}", "称\\emph{范德瓦耳斯相互作用}\\index{范德瓦耳斯相互作用}为相邻分子之间的一种较弱的吸引作用，", "它存在于所有分子之间，无论是否为极性分子：每个分子的电子", "都在不断运动，某一瞬间分子中电荷分布的不均匀，会吸引", "相邻分子中的相应电荷。在极性分子之间，", "永久部分电荷还会带来一份额外的吸引", "作用。", "\\end{definition}", "", "", "\\begin{proposition}[分子越大，吸引作用越强]\\label{prop:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:size}", "范德瓦耳斯相互作用随分子尺寸增大而增强，即", "随分子中电子数的增多而增强；在结构相似的分子之间，", "较大的分子具有较高的熔点和沸点。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在本阶段不加证明地承认：电子云较大的分子更容易变形，因此", "其瞬间电荷更大，", "且与相邻分子的接触更多。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[卤素]\\label{ex:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:halogens}", "% ledger: bp:F2, bp:Cl2, bp:Br2, bp:I2 (K values converted)", "\\ce{F2}、\\ce{Cl2}、\\ce{Br2}、\\ce{I2} 这些分子都是非极性分子，并且", "分子越来越大，它们的沸点也随之升高：", "\\qty{-188}{\\celsius}、\\qty{-34}{\\celsius}、\\qty{59}{\\celsius} 和", "\\qty{184}{\\celsius}。常温下，氟和氯为", "气体，溴为液体，碘为固体。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[壁虎]\\label{rem:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:gecko}", "单个范德瓦耳斯相互作用非常微弱，但它们可以累加。壁虎的", "趾垫上布满致密的微观绒毛，", "每根绒毛又分出更细的末端，这些末端与玻璃", "足够靠近，使范德瓦耳斯相互作用能在很大的总面积上发挥作用。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{氢键}", "", "\\begin{definition}[氢键]\\label{def:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:hydrogen-bond}", "称\\emph{氢键}\\index{氢键}为一种吸引作用，它存在于", "与电负性很大的原子（氮、氧或氟）相连的氢原子之间，", "（该氢原子带有明显的 $\\delta^+$）与另一个氮、氧或氟原子的", "孤电子对之间，后者常位于相邻分子中。氢键用虚线表示，", "涉及的三个原子几乎", "位于一条直线上。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % central water molecule and four neighbours, H-bonds dashed", "  \\newcommand{\\water}[4]{% name, x, y, rotation", "    \\begin{scope}[shift={(#2,#3)}, rotate=#4]", "      \\node[aO] (#1o) at (0,0) {};", "      \\node[aH] (#1a) at (-0.6,-0.45) {};", "      \\node[aH] (#1b) at (0.6,-0.45) {};", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond] (#1o.center) -- (#1a.center); \\draw[bond] (#1o.center) -- (#1b.center);", "    \\end{scope}}", "  \\water{m}{0}{0}{0}", "  \\water{p}{-1.62}{-1.215}{0}", "  \\water{q}{1.62}{-1.215}{0}", "  \\water{r}{-1.435}{1.435}{-8.13}", "  \\water{s}{1.435}{1.435}{8.13}", "  % H-bonds: m's H to p's O and q's O; r's and s's H to m's O", "  \\draw[dashed, omDef, thick] (ma) -- (po);", "  \\draw[dashed, omDef, thick] (mb) -- (qo);", "  \\draw[dashed, omDef, thick] (rb) -- (mo);", "  \\draw[dashed, omDef, thick] (sa) -- (mo);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}